    <description>Products:
Epic Secure Checkout (Usage) - FWSC1100
Integrated Financing (Payzen) - FWHC1600
Paper Statements - FWHC1200
Event Based Paper Suppression - FWSFS3100
Non-Installment Payments - FWSFEE-01
Service Fee - FWSFEE1000
Contingency fee - FWCFEE1000
Merchant Processing BPS - FWHC1340
Merchant Processing TX - FWHC1310
Merchant Processing Interchange - FWHC1320

HC ARR calculator. Updated 08/28/2024 to include Merchant processing Net Price and ARR. BOPI-511 Updated to calculate ARR when Quote Line Type not &apos;Cancellation&apos; or &apos;Renewal&apos;. BOPI-511 Updated 11/08/2024 to calculate the different merchant processing products. BOPI-589 Updated 11/26/2024 to replace deprecated Net Price field. BOPI-603 updated to set ARR to 0 for cancelled lines. BOPI-620 updated to set the ARR for cancelled lines to the original amount as a negative value
BOPI-727 Updated Paper Statements, Non-Installment Payments, Service Fee and Contingency fee calculation formulas. SALDEV-1158 Updated formula in the MerchantProcessingBPSNetPrice variable.

SALDEV - 1413: Quote Line fields Quoted_Usage_Amt__c, Quoted_Usage_Percent__c replaced with Average_Quoted_Usage_Amt__c, Average_Quoted_Usage_Percent__c in formulas: EpicSecureUsageARR, EpicSecureUsageRevenueCalculated, PaperSuppressionARR, NonInstallFeeARR, NonInstallmentPaymentsRevenueCalculated, ContingencyARR, ContingencyFeeRevenueCalculated</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Cancelled_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Original_Opportunity_Product_Cancellation.Opp_Product_ARR__c} * (-1)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Cancelled_NetARR</name>
